    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but even my \"private space\" isn't really mine. they still have opinions on how i should act, how i should think, even in my own room. it feels like the walls are closing in. when i say \"leaving everything behind,\" i mean a real exit. like, a way to just stop existing in this system so none of it can touch me anymore. is that even a valid thing to want? to just... stop?",
